</span>
<span id="A3.SS2.p2.pic1.1.6" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.SS2.p2.pic1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#800080;">Prompt<span id="A3.SS2.p2.pic1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Find me an empty spot on the table, thanks! 
