</span>
<span id="A3.SS3.p2.pic1.1.9" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.SS3.p2.pic1.1.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#800080;">Prompt<span id="A3.SS3.p2.pic1.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Look for the nearest available area on the table where no chairs are placed nearby.
