</span>
<span id="A3.SS3.p2.pic1.1.12" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.SS3.p2.pic1.1.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#800080;">Prompt<span id="A3.SS3.p2.pic1.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Search for a nearby open space on the table that has no chairs in its vicinity. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.4 </span>Where2Grasp</h3>

<div id="A3.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Where2Grasp benchmark requires the identification of objects based on key attributes including color, size, location, and category. The evaluation set consist 200 samples and encompasses over 40 common object categories sourced from a variety of household and office environments, with diverse backgrounds. This task emphasizes object-centric cognitive capabilities, focusing on the perception and interpretation of object characteristics under real-world conditions.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS4.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="1553.43" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 1553.43" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1553.43) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 1547.53 C 0 1550.79 2.64 1553.43 5.91 1553.43 L 544.09 1553.43 C 547.36 1553.43 550 1550.79 550 1547.53 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FCFCFF;" fill="#FCFCFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 1547.53 C 1.97 1549.7 3.73 1551.46 5.91 1551.46 L 544.09 1551.46 C 546.27 1551.46 548.03 1549.7 548.03 1547.53 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:110.08em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="1525.89" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 1523.2)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS4.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
