<span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">Response</span><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: </span><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Locations are <span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.2.3.1" class="ltx_text">&lt;point&gt;</span>(250, 212), (199, 214), (179, 226) <span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.2.3.2" class="ltx_text">&lt;/point&gt;</span>.</span></span>
</span>
